@node create remote links from local source files
@unnumberedsubsec create remote links from local source files

If you want to insert a link to a line in your source files@comma{} consider using @uref{https://github.com/sshaw/git-link}.

@node syntax highlighting for code blocks
@unnumberedsubsec syntax highlighting for code blocks

If you want verbatim code blocks in comments to have syntax highlighting@comma{}
consider installing
@uref{https://github.com/xuchunyang/shr-tag-pre-highlight.el}. @samp{fj-.el} uses @samp{shr}
for rendering@comma{} and @samp{shr-tag-pre-highlight} adds syntax highlighting support
to @samp{shr}. You may also need to customize @samp{shr-tag-pre-highlight-lang-modes} to
ensure the languages you want will work.

